- **Password**: `123456`
 
### Automated Installation
To automatically create the database and seed initial test accounts:
1. Start your local Apache & MySQL web server (e.g. XAMPP, WAMP, cPanel, or PHP built-in server).
2. Visit **`http://localhost/YANGO%20CLONE/install.php`** in your browser.
3. Click **"Run Automated Installation"**.
 
