## 📂 Project Directory Structure
 
```
YANGO CLONE/
├── config/
│   └── db.php                  # PDO database connection & session setup
├── api/
│   ├── auth.php                # Signup & Login API
│   ├── rides.php               # Ride & Parcel booking API
│   ├── driver.php              # Driver status, dispatch radar & trip step API
│   ├── location.php            # Driver GPS position simulation API
│   └── wallet.php              # Wallet top-up & ledger API
├── assets/
│   ├── css/
│   │   ├── main.css            # Yango core aesthetic & responsive design system
│   │   ├── dashboard.css       # Portal panels, cards & status steppers
│   │   └── leaflet-custom.css  # Dark map tile filter & pulse markers
│   └── js/
│       ├── main.js             # General UI interactivity & toast notifications
│       ├── map.js              # Leaflet map setup & route drawing helper
│       ├── passenger.js        # Passenger booking flow & active trip polling
│       └── driver.js           # Driver radar feed & status update controller
├── includes/
│   ├── header.php              # Navbar & user dropdown header layout
│   ├── footer.php              # Footer layout & script imports
│   └── auth_check.php          # Session middleware
├── db.sql                      # SQL database schema & seed script
├── install.php                 # Web automated installer script
├── index.php                   # Landing homepage with quick fare estimator
├── login.php                   # Authentication login form
├── signup.php                  # Registration form with passenger/driver selector
├── dashboard.php               # Passenger booking hub & live tracking map
├── driver_dashboard.php        # Driver dispatch console & radar map
├── wallet.php                  # Wallet recharge & transaction history page
├── profile.php                 # User profile settings page
└── logout.php                  # Logout handler script
```
 
